{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 32, :comments ["<b>Under the staff.</b> The shepherd's staff. Now, the one selected is the firstborn, and the tenth is equivalent, except that the tenth one may redeem it, unlike the firstborn. Now, one gives the firstborn and the tenth both in livestock and in the seed of the land, which is produce: first fruits and tithe."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:01.462504004Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}